Error [jet.CasingMismatch]: `meta.add_struct` was given the field name "two words", which is not an identifier
  --> tests/ui/meta_ladder_add_struct_refuses_a_computed_name.jet:11:10
    |
 11 |     meta.add_struct("Shape", fields, scope: "shape")
    |          ^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A name a build computes becomes a declaration of the generated module, so it must be one ASCII identifier in its kind's casing and can't write anything else
 Fix: Give `meta.add_struct` a field name in snake_case, as in `count`
